<%# Handoff 0096 -- the featured guide as a card under a section heading (was 0071's hero: small line, h1, summary,
    release line, two buttons and a side image). The whole card links to the guide page; the arrow is part of the
    card, not a second link, and the link reads as the guide's name. Badge: ProductLine#access_state with the
    /products card's label and colors (0068); the count is published episodes only (공개 예정 when none).
    Handoff 0097 -- the title is the operator's (SiteSetting, default 지금 시작하는 가이드) and up to three guides, in
    the operator's order. One guide: exactly 0096 (stacked below md, image 3 : text 2 from md). Two or three: below
    md a row of big cards that scrolls sideways (86% wide so the next one peeks in, snapping to each card's start,
    no script, scrollbar hidden; only this row scrolls -- it stays inside the section's 10px margins, so the last
    card ends 10px from the edge like the first starts); from md two or three stacked cards side by side.
    Rendered only when at least one featured guide is listed (the page skips it otherwise). %>
<% lines = @featured_lines %>
<section aria-labelledby="featured-guide-heading" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-2.5 pt-3.5 pb-[18px] sm:px-7 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-9">
  <h2 id="featured-guide-heading" class="break-keep break-words font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink"><%= @featured_title %></h2>
  <% if lines.one? %>
    <%= render "leedox_home/featured_card", line: lines.first, wide: true %>
  <% else %>
    <div data-featured-row class="mt-3 flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2.5 overflow-x-auto [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden md:grid md:gap-4 md:overflow-visible <%= lines.size == 2 ? "md:grid-cols-2" : "md:grid-cols-3" %>">
      <% lines.each do |line| %>
        <%= render "leedox_home/featured_card", line: line, wide: false %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>
